    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but I'm worried that just asking the procurement staff might be too obvious and allow someone to cover their tracks if it is intentional. Is there a way to look for more specific \"red flags\" or data anomalies in the ledger that might point to where the money is actually going, specifically looking for things that seem intentionally obscured or just \"out of place\"?",
